title: Party Disunity
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: party_disunity_timer = 0 and (dissent >= 0.3 or (reformist_dissent > 30 and not reformists_resign) or (center_dissent > 30 and not centrists_resign) or (left_dissent > 30 and not left_split) or (labor_dissent > 30 and not unions_independent) or (neorevisionist_dissent > 30 and neorevisionism))
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_disunity_timer = 4
card-image: img/es/parties/casa_pueblo.jpg
subtitle: Caballeristas, Prietistas, and the UGT are pulling the party in different directions.
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs


= Party Disunity

The party is being torn apart by internal dissent. Upset at the leadership and general direction, factions have started sabotaging their rivals, hampering our efforts to win votes and carry out our policies.

[? if reformist_dissent > 30 : The Prietistas are upset at our direction.  ?]
[? if center_dissent > 30 : The Besteiristas are displeased with the direction of our party. ?]
[? if labor_dissent > 30 : The <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT**</span> disagrees with our present course of action. ?]
[? if left_dissent > 30: The Caballeristas are making noises about another party split. ?]
[? if neorevisionist_dissent > 30 and neorevisionism = 1 : The anti-fascist mobilization current is in disagreement about our political direction. ?]

Something must be done to reinforce party unity.

- @enforce_unity
- @concessions_reformists
- @concessions_center
- @concessions_left
- @concessions_labor
- @concessions_neorevisionists
- @do_nothing
- @easy_discard

@enforce_unity
title: Enforce party discipline.
on-arrival: reformist_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 8; labor_dissent -= 8; left_dissent -= 8; neorevisionist_dissent -= 8; industrial_psoe -= (dissent * 10); urban_middle_psoe -= (dissent * 5); unemployed_psoe -= (dissent * 5)

Enforcing party discipline reduces dissent, but it could lead to an exit of dissenting members.

# enforcing party discipline applies to all parties.

# each party has a concessions action and an expulsions action.

@concessions_reformists
title: Give concessions to the Prietistas.
view-if: reformist_dissent > 30
on-arrival: reformist_dissent -= 15; left_dissent += 10

We have promised to adopt a more reformist posture. This may alienate the left, however.

@concessions_center
title: Give concessions to the Besteiristas.
view-if: center_dissent > 30
on-arrival: center_dissent -= 15; reformist_dissent += 8; left_dissent += 8; neorevisionist_dissent += 8

We have promised to take more policy suggestions from the Besteiristas. Both the left and reformist wings of the party might be displeased.

@concessions_left
title: Give concessions to the Caballeristas.
view-if: left_dissent > 30
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 15; reformist_dissent += 10; center_dissent += 5

We have promised that we will listen to the left wing of the party. Of course, this leads to increased dissent from the reformists and centrists.

@concessions_labor
title: Give concessions to the UGT.
view-if: labor_dissent > 30
on-arrival: labor_dissent -= 15; center_dissent += 10

The <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT**</span> will be granted more influence in party decision making. This upsets the Besteiristas, who would prefer to centralize political decision making within the party.

@concessions_neorevisionists
title: Give concessions to the anti-fascist mobilization current.
view-if: neorevisionist_dissent > 30 and neorevisionism = 1
on-arrival: neorevisionist_dissent -= 15; center_dissent += 10;

Giving this current more influence will cause increased dissent from the Besteiristas.


@do_nothing
title: Let the factions argue with themselves.
on-arrival: labor_dissent += 1; left_dissent += 1; center_dissent += 1; reformist_dissent += 1

Let the factions bicker; perhaps dissent is healthy for the party.


@expel_reformists
title: Expel the dissident reformists.
view-if: reformist_dissent > 30

@expel_left
title: Expel the dissident leftists.
view-if: left_dissent > 30

@expel_center
title: Expel the centrists.
view-if: center_dissent > 30

@expel_labor
title: Expel the labor supporters.
view-if: labor_dissent > 30
